      "body": "**Closed as integrated via #1450** (squash-merged to main as `000b41c6`), under the owner's instruction to clear the PR backlog. This PR's head is an ancestor of #1450's merged head, so its commits are on main in their reviewed and revised form. The kernel is on main. The performance attribution flagged in review (benchmarks that never ran the width-576 path) is superseded by #1450's width-576 measurements. References #820.",
